w-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-ico"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2v20M4.9 4.9l14.2 14.2M2 12h20M4.9 19.1L19.1 4.9M9 3l3 2 3-2M9 21l3-2 3 2M3 9l2 3-2 3M21 9l-2 3 2 3"/></svg></span></span><span class="card-body"><h2 class="card-t">Nor’easter &amp; Winter Storm Appraisal</h2><span class="card-p">Ice dams, snow load, frozen pipes and coastal wind from the storms that define Delaware winters.</span><span class="card-more">Learn more <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/appraisal-expertise/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="card-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-spreadsheet.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="card-ico"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg></span></span><span class="card-body"><h2 class="card-t">Carrier Estimate Review</h2><span class="card-p">A line-by-line audit of the insurer’s estimate before you accept, supplement or invoke 