<section class="sec sec-mist"><div class="wrap faq-wrap"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker dark">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most claims begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone invokes appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review gives you that answer within days, and many disputes end there.</p><a class="btn btn-slate" href="/appraisal-expertise/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to invoke appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle residential and commercial claims?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — houses, rowhomes, condos, multifamily, retail, office, warehouses, farms, churches and HOA properties.</p></div></details><details><summary>Which perils do you handle?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Wind, tornado, hurricane, nor’easter, hail, water, fire and smoke, plus other covered perils.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><h2>Have a claim that doesn’t add up?</h2><p>Send us the carrier’s estimate and your photos. We’ll tell you plainly what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-coral" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/start-your-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
